          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: During a Rome-Paris flight, a passenger observed a bright, elongated object moving from right to left below the plane. The pilot, questioned upon arrival, recalled seeing at the time indicated by the passenger a bright plane in the setting sun moving from right to left. This aircraft left a faint condensation trail behind it. The witness likely saw this aircraft.",
